{"id":"71801f5b9407391a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-connected.md","title":"Connected","display":"df-connected — Connected","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-connected","aliases":["58-df-connected","Connected"],"display":"df-connected — Connected","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-connected"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-connected</span><span>Connected</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-connected — Connected"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{[0,1]}\">\\(\\tau_{[0,1]}\\)</span> is the Euclidean subspace topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S,\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S,\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S,\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S,\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\)</span>，取所引内部实子空间拓扑定义的唯一值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\neg\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(U\\neq\\emptyset\\land V\\neq\\emptyset\\land\nU\\cap V=\\emptyset\\land U\\cup V=X\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\neg\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(U\\neq\\emptyset\\land V\\neq\\emptyset\\land\nU\\cap V=\\emptyset\\land U\\cup V=X\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disconnected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disconnected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Topology is part of every predicate. A bare carrier set has no determined connectedness.</li>\n<li>Path connectedness implies connectedness; that implication is a theorem rather than a defining clause.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Willard, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{[0,1]}","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connected}_S,\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S,\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\neg\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(U\\neq\\emptyset\\land V\\neq\\emptyset\\land\nU\\cap V=\\emptyset\\land U\\cup V=X\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\n\\land\\gamma(0)=x\\land\\gamma(1)=y\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disconnected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Connected}_S(X,\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"3315c3af8b987983","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6bf4dc15ff0b29d5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b3c8bda61bc135a4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Connected}_S$ is the two-place predicate from [[58-df-connected]] and $\\operatorname{Components}$ is the set-valued term defined below"},{"id":"6615a57b9cb224a4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"413736d776e8d283","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b42ccbebbab8162","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4901c0343d9dbe4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Connected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]] and [[../batch10/58-df-connected.md]])"},{"id":"ad60b464ec6e147e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"